  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a tribute to the open road with this custom patriotic trucker comforter set from Jeminise. Featuring a bold semi truck design set against an American flag background under a starry night sky, this high-quality bedding is the perfect gift for professional drivers, truck enthusiasts, and patriotic families alike. Add a custom name to create a truly unique and meaningful personalized bedding piece.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this patriotic bedding with a name of your choice to make a thoughtful, one-of-a-kind gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Patriotic Trucking Theme:</strong> Features a beautifully rendered digital illustration of a semi truck with an American flag and night sky stars.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Fabric Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric that is lightweight, breathable, and incredibly soft to the touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durability &amp; Comfort:</strong> Uses advanced eco-friendly printing techniques to prevent colors from fading, along with smooth, compact stitching along the edges.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; air dry or tumble dry on low heat to keep the microfiber fluffy and vibrant.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Your package includes one customized comforter (or duvet cover) with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheets.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Flag Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
